  box is `[0.1, 0.2, 0.5, 0.9]`, the upper-left and bottom-right coordinates of
  the bounding box will be `(40, 10)` to `(180, 50)` (in (x,y) coordinates).

  Parts of the bounding box may fall outside the image.

